<h2 class=\"font-bold text-sm\">استخدام موقعي الحالي</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-emerald-600\">تحديد العنوان تلقائياً عبر نظام الجي بي إس</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <form id=\"addressForm\" class=\"space-y-4\">\n                \n                <!-- Emirate Picker -->\n                <div>\n                    <label class=\"block text-gray-700 text-sm font-semibold mb-1.5\" for=\"emirate\">الإمارة</label>\n                    <div class=\"relative\">\n                        <select id=\"emirate\" class=\"w-full bg-gray-50 border border-gray-300 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-gray-800 appearance-none focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-600 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-emerald-600\">\n                            <option value=\"Dubai\" selected>دبي (Dubai)</option>\n                            <option value=\"Abu Dhabi\">أبوظبي (Abu Dhabi)</option>\n                            <option value=\"Sharjah\">الشارقة (Sharjah)</option>\n                            <option value=\"Ajman\">عجمان (Ajman)</option>\n                            <option value=\"Umm Al Quwain\">أم القيوين (Umm Al Quwain)</option>\n                            <option value=\"Ras Al Khaimah\">رأس الخيمة (Ras Al Khaimah)</option>\n                            <option value=\"Fujairah\">الفجيرة (Fujairah)</option>\n                        </select>\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-0 flex items-center px-4 pointer-events-none text-gray-500\">\n                            <i class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-sm\"></i>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Area -->\n                <div>\n                    <label class=\"block text-gray-700 text-sm font-semibold mb-1.5\" for=\"area\">المنطقة / الحي</label>\n                    <input type=\"text\" id=\"area\" placeholder=\"مثال: دبي مارينا، داون تاون دبي\" \n                        class=\"w-full bg-gray-50 border border-gray-300 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-gray-800 placeholder-gray-400 focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-600 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-emerald-600\">\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Street -->\n                <div>\n                    <label class=\"block text-gray-700 text-sm font-semibold mb-1.5\" for=\"street\">الشارع</label>\n                    <input type=\"text\" id=\"street\" placeholder=\"مثال: شارع الشيخ زايد، شارع المرقبات\" \n                        class=\"w-full bg-gray-50 border border-gray-300 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-gray-800 placeholder-gray-400 focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-600 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-emerald-600\">\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Building or Villa -->\n                <div>\n                    <label class=\"block text-gray-700 text-sm font-semibold mb-1.5\" for=\"building\">المبنى أو الفيلا ورقم الشقة</label>\n                    <input type=\"text\" id=\"building\" placeholder=\"مثال: برج الروضة، شقة رقم 402، أو فيلا 12\" \n                        class=\"w-full bg-gray-50 border border-gray-300 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-gray-800 placeholder-gray-400 focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-600 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-emerald-600\">\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Makani Number -->\n                <div>\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center mb-1.5\">\n                        <label class=\"block text-gray-700 text-sm font-semibold\" for=\"makani\">رقم مكاني (اختياري)</label>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs text-gray-400\">10 أرقام</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <input type=\"text\" id=\"makani\" maxlength=\"10\" placeholder=\"مثال: 3004998822\" \n                        class=\"w-full bg-gray-50 border border-gray-300 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-gray-800 placeholder-gray-400 focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-600 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-emerald-600 tracking-wider\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[11px] text-gray-500 mt-1\">يساعد رقم مكاني السائق في الوصول إليك بدقة شديدة.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Phone Number -->\n                <div>\n                    <label class=\"block text-gray-700 text-sm font-semibold mb-1.5\" for=\"phone\">رقم الهاتف المتحرك</label>\n                    <div class=\"relative flex items-center\">\n                        <span class=\"absolute right-4 text-gray-500 font-medium text-sm\">+971</span>\n                        <input type=\"tel\" id=\"phone\" placeholder=\"050 123 4567\" \n                            class=\"w-full bg-gray-50 border border-gray-300 rounded-xl pr-16 pl-4 py-3 text-gray-800 placeholder-gray-400 focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-600 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-emerald-600 text-left\" dir=\"ltr\">\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </form>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Fixed Bottom Button Footer -->\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-white border-t border-gray-200 p-4 shadow-lg\">\n            <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"alert('تم حفظ العنوان بنجاح!')\" \n                class=\"w-full bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white font-bold py-3.5 px-4 rounded-xl shadow-md transition duration-200 text-center text-base\">\n                حفظ العنوان\n            </button>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n```",
